+# Sprint 0 — Base Setup Complete ✅
+
+**Date:** August 8, 2026  
+**Status:** ✅ Ready for Sprint 1  
+**Commit:** TBD
+
+---
+
+## Summary
+
+Sprint 0 has initialized the complete FlowStudio monorepo infrastructure with PostgreSQL, Redis, and a NestJS API scaffold. The project is now ready for feature development.
+
+---
+
+## Completed Tasks
+
+### 1. Monorepo Structure ✅
+- Root `package.json` with workspaces configuration
+- `apps/` directory structure:
+  - `apps/web/` — Next.js 14 frontend (existing)
+  - `apps/api/` — NestJS 10.3 backend (new)
+  - `apps/engine/` — (placeholder for Sprint 6)
+  - `apps/media/` — (placeholder for Sprint 8)
+- `packages/` shared modules:
+  - `packages/ir/` — Intermediate Representation (IR) types
+  - `packages/registry/` — Model Registry contracts
+
+### 2. Database & Infrastructure ✅
+- **docker-compose.yml** with:
+  - PostgreSQL 16 (port 5432)
+  - Redis 7 (port 6379)
+  - pgAdmin 4 (port 5050)
+  - Health checks configured
+  - Persistent volumes
+
+### 3. Prisma Schema ✅
+Complete schema with 13 models:
+- **Auth**: User, UserProfile
+- **Content**: Project, Sequence, Shot
+- **AI**: AiProvider, AiModel
+- **Ledger**: Generation, Job
+- **Billing**: Wallet, Transaction
+- All relationships, indexes, and constraints defined
+
+### 4. NestJS API ✅
+- **Core**: AppModule, AppController, AppService
+- **Configuration**: ConfigModule (environment-based)
+- **Database**: PrismaService, PrismaModule with lifecycle hooks
+- **Entry Point**: main.ts with validation and CORS
+- **Health Check**: `/health` endpoint that checks database connection
+
+### 5. Shared Packages ✅
+
+#### `@flowstudio/ir` — Type Definitions
+- ProjectIR, SequenceIR, ShotIR
+- BriefIR, ShotBriefIR
+- GenerationIR
+- Request/Response DTOs
+- Model Registry IR
+
+#### `@flowstudio/registry` — Model Contracts
+- Modality enum: TEXT, IMAGE, VIDEO, AUDIO
+- Camera control levels: NONE, BASIC, ADVANCED
+- Region reachable: IRAN, HETZNER, BOTH
+- Model contracts for each modality
+- Provider contract
+- ModelAdapter interface
+
+### 6. Development Files ✅
+- `.env.example` with all required variables
+- `.env.local` for local development (git-ignored)
+- `.gitignore` for API and root
+- TypeScript configurations for all apps and packages
+- NestJS CLI configuration (nest-cli.json)
+- ESLint and Jest configurations
+
+---
+
+## Directory Structure
+
+```
+flowstudio/
+├── apps/
+│   ├── web/               # Next.js frontend (existing)
+│   │   ├── app/
+│   │   ├── package.json
+│   │   ├── tsconfig.json
+│   │   └── next.config.js
+│   └── api/               # NestJS backend (NEW)
+│       ├── src/
+│       │   ├── main.ts                       # Entry point
+│       │   ├── app.module.ts                 # Root module
+│       │   ├── app.controller.ts             # Health check
+│       │   ├── app.service.ts
+│       │   └── common/
+│       │       └── prisma/
+│       │           ├── prisma.service.ts     # DB connection
+│       │           └── prisma.module.ts
+│       ├── prisma/
+│       │   └── schema.prisma                 # Database schema
+│       ├── package.json
+│       ├── tsconfig.json
+│       ├── nest-cli.json
