-## Important Notes
-
-### Environment Setup
-- **Development**: Uses `.env.local` (git-ignored)
-- **Example**: See `.env.example` for all required variables
-- **Database**: PostgreSQL at `localhost:5432` (user: `flowstudio`)
-- **Redis**: At `localhost:6379` (no auth in dev)
-
-### Project Structure Philosophy
-- **Monorepo**: Apps and packages share types via npm workspaces
-- **Separation**: Code is copied from wbc, not reused via imports
-- **Modality**: Abstract ModelAdapter allows plugging new models
-- **IR**: All data flows through intermediate representation types
-
-### Prisma Best Practices
-- **Schema**: In `prisma/schema.prisma`
-- **Migrations**: Auto-create via `db push` (dev) or `migrate` (production)
-- **Client**: Auto-generated, use via `PrismaService`
-- **Studio**: Visual editor at `localhost:5555`
